  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>JAGM 奇異鳥模組</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">現已支援 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Fabric</span>、<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">NeoForge</span> 與 <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Forge</span>！</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">歡迎！這是我為移居紐西蘭的朋友製作的搬家禮物模組，經潤飾後公開釋出。靈感源自 Lordloss_ 的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cute-kiwi-birds-new-animal\" rel=\"nofollow\">可愛奇異鳥模組</a>（該模組自 1.16 版後未再更新）。所有程式碼與資源皆為原創。</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>特色功能</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">奇異鳥會在多數<strong>森林生態域</strong>中生成。<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">牠們會偶爾<strong>挖掘物品</strong>，包括種子、漿果，有時還會挖到鐵粒與金粒，掉落內容可透過資料包配置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">可用<strong>種子繁殖</strong>，會<strong>產卵</strong>，機制與雞蛋相同。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">若擊殺奇異鳥（你這惡魔），會掉落<strong>奇異果</strong>，可食用或製作成美味的<strong>蛋白霜蛋糕</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">有機率生成<strong>雷射奇異鳥</strong>取代普通奇異鳥，請小心。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">如同現實，奇異鳥<strong>易受外來掠食者侵害</strong>，別讓你的寵物貓太靠近！</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>注意事項</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">本模組支援 Forge、NeoForge 與 Fabric！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">歡迎將本模組用於模組包，其他分授權問題請參考授權條款。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">原始碼與問題追蹤請至<a href=\"https://github.com/J4gm/jagmkiwis-multiloader\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>，歡迎回報錯誤或崩潰問題！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:14px\">若想追蹤我的動態，請至<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tumblr.com%252fj4gm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tumblr</a>或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fj4gm.bsky.social%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bluesky</a>。</span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
